###___ User Endpoints ___###

#Api call for user creation
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user1",
    "email":"user1@gmail.com",
    "password":"password"
}

# APi call for token generation
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user1",
    "password":"password"
}




#Api Call for getting loged in user
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/me/
Accept: application/json
# Authorization: Basic user1:password
Authorization: Token 8820d0bfa2f9ee6c6bf145ad1c52e2a9688b7a45




###___ Expense Endpoints ___###

#Api call for listing all Expense under user
###
